  "title": "Chicken Bone Broth",
  "description": "For this recipe, chicken bone broth is made by roasting a leftover chicken carcass to draw out the marrow followed by a slow simmer for 4 to 5 hours.",
  "authors": [
    "Diana71"
  ],
