  "ingredients": [
    "aluminum foil",
    "1 leftover chicken carcass, broken into pieces",
    "1 onion, roughly chopped",
    "6 cups water, or as needed to cover",
    "2 tablespoons apple cider vinegar",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "0.5 tablespoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_swgLvO2xuLEs_uZjxZhyBi4qUs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275984-chicken-bone-broth-DDMFS-KH-ingredients-9d324b15eedb4f288eaadb9e6e403954.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275984/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken bones on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0wuFXnBktObS4q3f2dXgNFkcDnU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275984-chicken-bone-broth-DDMFS-KH-step2-1144094715ea45bba613c553d04349f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275984/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast in the preheated oven for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/K-RqMvp9rBX2O-drNQI9QQF-5TU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275984-chicken-bone-broth-DDMFS-KH-step3-6d646b062b0043388caa5eb17f68cb3e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275984/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer bones to a large, heavy stockpot. Add onion and enough water to cover by 2 inches. Add vinegar, salt, and black pepper; bring to a boil over high heat. Reduce heat to medium-low; simmer, partially covered, leaving enough space for steam to escape, for 4 to 5 hours. Check occasionally, remove any froth or foam that develops on top of water with a large spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xbOcmuLTxQa_uHfgRzJ-V6d7rlU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275984-chicken-bone-broth-DDMFS-KH-step4-cb4ca0521b6c4810aabba6c9cef24469.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275984/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the heat; cool slightly. Strain broth through a fine-mesh sieve into a clean pot. Cool completely at room temperature, then store in the refrigerator. Use within 5 days or freeze until ready to use.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qJPFE33lRe2ba4ogdBFnbS_ah8Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275984-chicken-bone-broth-DDMFS-KH-step5-753d4982517a4baa9a3ed13f5ef3b393.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275984/step_05.webp"
    }
